               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Position besteht aus:</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 1 x Bodenplatte mit Sickerloch</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 1 x Einführungsrahmen, h = 400 mm</span>
               <br/>
