               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Wanddicke: 100 mm</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Position besteht aus:</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 1 x Bodenplatte mit Sickerloch</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 2 x Einführungsrahmen, h = 400 mm</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 1 x Deckenplatte mit Einstiegsöffnung 70/70 cm</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">- 1 x Deckelrahmen Klasse A</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Oberkante Deckel = Oberkante Gelände.</span>
               <br/>
               <span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;Color:rgb(0,0,0);">Erd- und Schotterarbeiten werden gesondert vergütet.</span>
